# Working copies of a capture run. The promoted fixture under verifier/test/fixtures
# IS committed: it is this project's own token, and committing it means the test suite
# runs and the demo shows a real passing verification on a fresh clone, with no GCP
# account required. What must never be committed is somebody else's token.
